                            <comment id="494501" author="JIRAUSER18433" created="Wed, 13 May 2026 23:32:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;simul doesn&apos;t seem to have been updated for a long time. Maybe we should just copy down our own version in lustre/tests/?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="494514" author="adilger" created="Thu, 14 May 2026 06:10:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m not against it, since that would mean better test coverage.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="494545" author="gerrit" created="Thu, 14 May 2026 16:58:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Timothy Day &amp;lt;timday@thelustrecollective.com&amp;gt;&quot; uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65894&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65894&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
