Project: fs/lustre-release&lt;br/&gt;
Branch: master&lt;br/&gt;
Current Patch Set: 1&lt;br/&gt;
Commit: 2f71f079bde008de843864238a525ff6ef71e299&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="494547" author="colmstea" created="Thu, 14 May 2026 18:07:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;simul is now installed on test nodes for all distro flavors. I&apos;ll check test results tomorrow to verify the change.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
